OL,3,A'We came back from hell', say
OL,4,AUkrainians after years in
OL,5,ARussia-occupied front-line city
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning: This story contains graphic
OL,8,Fcontent.
OL,10,FOlha has one word to describe what life
OL,11,Fhas been like in the front-line city of
OL,12,FOleshky over the past few years:
OL,13,F"Horror".
OL,15,FDisembarking alongside her from a coach
OL,16,Fin the Ukrainian region of Chernihiv
OL,17,Fwith their immediate family and dog,
OL,18,Fher husband Viacheslav put it this way:
OL,19,F"We came back from hell."
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
